[00:25.58]Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn,
[00:29.39]God’s duly appointed King.
[00:34.00]He reigns for truth and justice;
[00:39.24]Rich blessings his rule will bring.
[00:44.02]With dignity and splendor
[00:48.16]And love for God’s great name,
[00:53.76]He’ll vindicate Jehovah,
[00:58.56]His sov’reignty proclaim.
[01:04.06](Chorus)
[01:04.21]Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn!
[01:08.54]All praise God’s anointed Son.
[01:13.48]Installed upon Mount Zion,
[01:18.20]His Kingship has now begun!
[01:24.30]Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn,
[01:32.66]Who died so that we may live.
[01:37.88]He humbly paid the ransom;
[01:42.45]Our sins God can now forgive.
[01:47.66]The bride of Christ awaits him,
[01:52.74]Adorned for him in white.
[01:57.42]This marriage in the heavens
[02:01.66]Will prove God’s rule is right.
[02:08.86](Chorus)
[02:09.01]Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn!
[02:14.56]All praise God’s anointed Son.
[02:19.08]Installed upon Mount Zion,
[02:24.30]His Kingship has now begun!
